Hi {Owner},

I build websites for property management companies around {City}. {Business Name} manages good rentals, but no page tells an owner your fees, what management includes or what their statement would look like.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: an owner proposal page with fees, a rental analysis request labelled as an estimate, a sample owner statement, rental listings with published screening criteria, a maintenance page that sorts emergencies and an HOA section, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and listing updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
